OL,3,AMet Police urge students to move 7
OL,4,AOctober protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police is calling on
OL,7,Fthe organisers of a pro-Palestinian
OL,8,Fstudent march planned to take place on
OL,9,Fthe third anniversary of the 7 October
OL,10,Fattacks on Israel to move the event.
OL,12,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner James
OL,13,FHarman said the force had been unable
OL,14,Fto identify the organisers behind the
OL,15,Fgroup, which calls itself the
OL,16,FUniversity of London Coalition.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
