OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMet Police urge students to move 7
OL,4,AOctober protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said that while the march did not
OL,7,Fmeet the strict legal threshold at
OL,8,Fwhich police could request the home
OL,9,Fsecretary to ban a protest, many
OL,10,FLondoners would be marking "a day of
OL,11,Fmourning" with vigils to remember those
OL,12,Fwho died.
OL,14,FThe BBC has contacted the group for
OL,15,Fcomment via social media accounts they
OL,16,Fappear to be associated with.
